The personal Claude Code adapter in iativa/agent/claude_code.py adapts the
isolated CLI invocation pattern of server/drivers/claude-background.ts and
the authentication status checks of server/drivers/claude-auth-status.ts.
The interface-driven login flow in iativa/agent/claude_login.py adapts the
CLI login lifecycle and official authorization-link checks from
server/drivers/claude-login-auth.ts. Native executable discovery also follows
the platform-aware lookup pattern in server/env-path.ts.
The implementation has been rewritten in Python for IAtiva, with mandatory
isolation flags, bounded output, strict response validation, and sanitized errors.

